      h2 Quick start
      text Get started by including Bootstrap’s production-ready CSS and JavaScript via CDN without the need for any build steps. See it in practice with this .
      link "Bootstrap CodePen demo" https://codepen.io/team/bootstrap/pen/qBamdLj
      text Include the  tag as well for  in mobile devices.
      text Create a new index.html file in your project root.
      text "<meta name=\"viewport\">" danger
      link "proper responsive behavior" https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Viewport_meta_tag
      card
        button Copy
        card
          text "<!doctype html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Bootstrap demo</title> </head> <body> <h1>Hello, world!</h1> </body> </html>"
      text Place the  tag in the  for our CSS, and the  tag for our JavaScript bundle (including Popper for positioning dropdowns, popovers, and tooltips) before the closing . Learn more about our .
      text Include Bootstrap’s CSS and JS.
      text <link> danger
      text <head> danger
      text <script> danger
      text </body> danger
      link "CDN links" #cdn-links
      card
        button Copy
        card
          text "<!doctype html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"> <title>Bootstrap demo</title> <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" integrity=\"sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"> </head> <body> <h1>Hello, world!</h1> <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script> </body> </html>"
      text You can also include  and our JS separately. If you don’t plan to use dropdowns, popovers, or tooltips, save some kilobytes by not including Popper.
      link Popper https://github.com/floating-ui/popper-docs/blob/main/docs/v2/index.md
      card
        button Copy
        card
          text "<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@popperjs/core@2.11.8/dist/umd/popper.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-I7E8VVD/ismYTF4hNIPjVp/Zjvgyol6VFvRkX/vR+Vc4jQkC+hVqc2pM8ODewa9r\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script> <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-G/EV+4j2dNv+tEPo3++6LCgdCROaejBqfUeNjuKAiuXbjrxilcCdDz6ZAVfHWe1Y\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>"
      text Open the page in your browser of choice to see your Bootstrapped page. Now you can start building with Bootstrap by creating your own , adding dozens of , and utilizing .
      text Hello, world!
