        link "the community Discord" https://discord.gg/bZUvakRU3M
        link "Bootstrap subreddit" https://www.reddit.com/r/bootstrap/
      text Chat with fellow Bootstrappers in IRC. On the irc.libera.chat server, in the #bootstrap channel.
      text Implementation help may be found at Stack Overflow (tagged ).
      link bootstrap-5 https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/bootstrap-5
      text Developers should use the keyword  on packages that modify or add to the functionality of Bootstrap when distributing through  or similar delivery mechanisms for maximum discoverability.
